url: https://manga.nicovideo.jp/comic/22768
why: '球詠, in きららベース. Every field the adapter reads is here, on one page.

  THE SIDEBAR IS THE COUNTER-CASE AND NOT PADDING. It renders a banner for every official
  channel on

  the site, opening with ニコニコ漫画（公式） at /official/nicomanga, so a channel pattern that
  is not

  scoped to the breadcrumb answers nicomanga here, and did for all 180 works we held.
  A fixture

  without it is one the broken pattern passes.

  The rendered episode list is the platform''s own selection and not the work: 4 items
  out of 244,

  numbered 1, 20, 243 and 244, with 番外編 at 20 sitting between them. That is the shape
  that decides

  whether the newest episode is read by position or by number.'
